als seem disconnected from the detailed analysis. Score: +2 (candidate better).\n\nOverall, the candidate report demonstrates substantially better visual presentation practice through explicit chart references, varied visualization types, and active integration of visuals into the analytical narrative. The baseline report is visually minimal and does not leverage graphics to enhance insight communication. Since neither report includes actual images, scores are conservative but reflect clear differences in visual reporting approach.",
