d), 0 for 1.1.A.4 (values not computed), 0 for 1.1.A.5 (statement not about combined group), 0 for 1.1.A.6 (similar), 0 for 1.1.A.7 (statement about weight not about combined group). Total score for Criterion 1.1 = sum = 2.",
