 plot interpretation. The baseline report is more focused on identifying problems than anticipating the implications of findings. Score: +1.\n\nOverall, the candidate report shows markedly greater analytical depth by examining more facets of the data, using more robust quantitative evidence, deriving more nuanced insights, and better connecting analysis to business impact.",
