ibed, purposefully placed charts that enhance comprehension. The Baseline report’s visual elements are opaque and poorly integrated. Given the scoring range of -10 to +10, the total differential across the three sub-dimensions is +5, but since the maximum per sub-dimension is limited and the Baseline is not actively misleading (just weak), a final score of +4 reflects a clear improvement while staying within reasonable bounds.",
